# Every production ladder under Answering::Any, keyed by its function, with
# its pin or its row (scripts/gates/any-climb-pins.sh):
#   <file> <fn> <count> pin <test fn>   a test reading the production function
#                                       with a kept reading ahead of an answer
#                                       (or two kept readings ranked), red under
#                                       a first-refusal loop;
#   <file> <fn> <count> row <row id>    no cheap fixture: the row names the one
#                                       its pin needs.
# A new Any ladder reds until it is named here.
crates/geom-brep/src/chart_singularity.rs holds 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/geom-brep/src/edge_nurbs.rs measured_ends 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/geom-brep/src/props/curved.rs pole_side 1 pin an_arc_holding_the_pole_answers_past_an_arc_in_band
