crates/topo/src/boolean/rim_wedge.rs rim_exists 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/topo/src/boolean/sectors.rs crescent 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
