crates/topo/src/census.rs planar_interiors_meet 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/topo/src/census.rs probe_vertices 1 pin an_abort_stops_the_probe_and_a_limit_outranks_in_band
crates/topo/src/census.rs shared_interior_witness 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
crates/topo/src/census.rs shared_run 1 row t4-ports-unpinned-for-a-kept-reading-ahead-of-an-answer
